{
  "episode": 9,
  "title": "THE SNAP",
  "infection": 0.6,
  "shots": [
    {
      "scene": "lineup",
      "text": "The day it changed, Kesh picked an old worker from my colony.",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "options": {
        "walker": "kesh"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "nursery",
      "text": "The ant who used to feed me in the nursery, back when I was so small I couldn't carry my own crumb.",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "options": {
        "hatch": true
      },
      "note": "Memory: the nursery, warm light."
    },
    {
      "scene": "execution",
      "text": "He raised his stinger, and before I even decided to, I moved.",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "tense": true,
      "options": {
        "phase": "raise"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "closeup",
      "text": "One {snap}snap.",
      "pause": 0.9,
      "camera": "still"
    },
    {
      "scene": "execution",
      "text": "Kesh dropped, and the whole chamber went silent. Not one ant breathed. I waited for them to kill me.",
      "pause": 0.7,
      "tense": true,
      "options": {
        "phase": "fallen"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "kesh",
      "text": "Instead, the fire queen's general stepped forward, looked at the body, then looked at me.",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "options": {
        "general": true
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "kesh",
      "text": "\"You,\" he said. \"You fight for us now.\" Then he pointed at Vask. \"Prove it.\"",
      "pause": 0.7,
      "options": {
        "general": true
      },
      "camera": "push"
    },
    {
      "scene": "vask",
      "text": "Vask backed away. He begged. He said we were brothers, that we came from the same dirt.",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "tense": true,
      "options": {
        "phase": "beg"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "closeup",
      "text": "I didn't hesitate. One {snap}snap.",
      "pause": 0.8,
      "camera": "still",
      "infection": 0.7
    },
    {
      "scene": "ranks",
      "text": "The fire soldiers cheered.",
      "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
      "scene": "lineup",
      "text": "My own colony stared at me like I was a monster.",
      "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
      "scene": "lineup",
      "text": "I should've said no. I should've stood with my own.",
      "pause": 0.6
    },
    {
      "scene": "army",
      "text": "But when they gave me Kesh's armor and the fire soldiers stepped aside as I walked past...",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "fire": true,
      "options": {
        "armor": true
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "closeup",
      "text": "something in my blood purred. The green in my veins burned brighter than it ever had.",
      "pause": 0.7,
      "infection": 0.85,
      "options": {
        "armor": true
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "lineup",
      "text": "The old worker whispered, \"Thank you, 250.\"",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "options": {
        "focus": "old"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "hero",
      "text": "I didn't answer. I didn't even look back.",
